# ClipForge Studio

ClipForge Studio is a rights-safe short-form video production app built for local testing and future deployment.

## Features

- Email sign-up and sign-in
- Session management and sign-out-everywhere
- Rights-safe project creation with explicit ownership confirmation
- Music license and permission guardrails
- Render status flow using FFmpeg when available
- Reference Lab analysis mock
- Reality Generator brief generation for photorealistic, 3D cartoon, animation, and sports modes
- Platform connection mocks for YouTube, TikTok, and Instagram
- Local JSON persistence and localhost-ready deployment

## Requirements

- Node.js 22.5 or newer
- FFmpeg installed and available in PATH for local render simulation

## Run locally

```bash
node --no-warnings server.js
```

Then visit:

- http://localhost:3000
- http://localhost:3000/app

## Tests

```bash
npm test
```

## Notes

This app is intentionally local-first and rights-safe. Real AI generation and platform publishing require service provider keys and production credentials.
